 wet, using appropriate shampoo, rinsing throughly, towel drying, blow drying, brushing out once dry, cleaning out eye boogers and ears with grooming wipes also making sure face/head/ears are brushed, spray with perfume if applicable)"},"match_method":"category_and_task_text"},{"item_key":"pct_bathing_008_cleaning_grooming_how_to_clean_dryers_swee","section_title":"Bathing","source_row":23,"readiness_status":"not_started","item_status":"not_started","demonstrated_by":"","verified_by":"","note_text":"","raw_values":{"checkbox_status":"FALSE","demonstrated_by":"","verified_accuracy_by":"","category_task_text":"Cleaning Grooming (how to clean dryers, sweep whole room and tubs/moving everything out of the way to get underneath, disinfecting boots and aprons with spray, how to clean grates in dryers, wipe down surfaces, clean brushes before putting away)"},"match_method":"category_and_task_text"},{"item_key":"pct_bathing_009_has_bathed_short_haired_dog","section_title":"Bathing","source_row":24,"readiness_status":"verified","item_status":"complete","demonstrated_by":"Angelina D","verified_by":"Angelina D","note_text":"","raw_values":{"checkbox_status":"TRUE","demonstrated_by":"Angelina D","verified_accuracy_by":"Angelina D","category_task_text":"Has bathed short-haired dog"},"match_method":"category_and_task_text"},{"item_key":"pct_bathing_010_has_bathed_long_haired_dog","section_title":"Bathing","source_row":25,"readiness_status":"verified","item_status":"complete","demonstrated_by":"Angelina D","verified_by":"Angelina D","note_text":"","raw_values":{"checkbox_status":"TRUE","demonstrated_by":"Angelina D","verified_accuracy_by":"Angelina D","category_task_text":"Has bathed long-haired dog"},"match_method":"category_and_task_text"},{"item_key":"pct_bathing_011_has_bathed_double_coated_dog","section_title":"Bathing","source_row":26,"readiness_status":"verified","item_status":"complete","demonstrated_by":"Angelina D","verified_by":"Angelina D","note_text":"","raw_values":{